@startuml
|User|
start
:Initiate HVAC subsystem diagnosis;

|System|
:Obtain sensed data\n(temperatures, pressures, current, machine state, etc.);
if (Sensed data source?) then (Real-time)
  :Acquire sensed data in real time\nfrom data acquisition hardware;
else (Post-acquisition)
  :Retrieve sensed data at arbitrary time\nafter acquisition from device storage;
endif

:Obtain fixed data\n(specifications, design info, operating characteristics, set points);
:Load fixed data from permanent storage;

:Preprocess data;
:Reduce / filter / prepare data for diagnostics;
:Perform averaging / trending /\nstatistical analysis as needed;

:Run diagnostic component;
:Detect and identify faults\nusing algorithms derived from expert practices;

:Generate diagnostic results;

:Display results in simple\ngraphical and textual format;
:Record results to permanent storage;

|User|
:View diagnostic results;

|System|
:Store results for subsequent retrieval and analysis;
stop
@enduml